You really shouldn't…

00:16:15.125 --> 00:16:16.500
bring his mom into this.

00:16:17.125 --> 00:16:18.208
What?

00:16:26.958 --> 00:16:28.875
Hey.

00:16:29.791 --> 00:16:31.291
Really funny, huh?

00:16:35.625 --> 00:16:37.583
The Fashion Design
students are fighting!

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:41.958
Hey, look.
They're really fighting.

00:16:45.166 --> 00:16:46.541
Isn't that Jin-seong?

00:16:46.666 --> 00:16:48.541
Woah.
Those two? Oh, no.

00:16:54.333 --> 00:16:57.750
Hey, I… I wasn't trying
to start a fight with you.

00:16:59.458 --> 00:17:03.083
I can see that. Your pose is crap
to begin with.

00:17:03.625 --> 00:17:05.958
Jin-seong. Please, don’t.

00:17:17.208 --> 00:17:19.083
-Whoa…
-Goodness…

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:22.416
Hong Jae-yeol,
you better let go.

00:17:22.916 --> 00:17:24.666
-Uh…
-Oh, no.

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:27.208
Let go, you bastard!

00:17:27.583 --> 00:17:29.541
What's going on?

00:17:32.791 --> 00:17:34.916
<i>Jin-seong's punch</i>
<i>is so freaking fast.</i>

00:17:35.041 --> 00:17:36.500
<i>I couldn't even see it.</i>

00:17:37.166 --> 00:17:38.500
<i>I can see it.</i>

00:17:38.958 --> 00:17:41.916
<i>I've been getting beaten up so much</i>
<i>since I was little.</i>

00:17:42.041 --> 00:17:45.916
<i>That at some point,</i>
<i>I started to see the punches.</i>

00:17:46.291 --> 00:17:49.791
<i>It's just that my body</i>
<i>couldn't react fast enough.</i>

00:17:50.208 --> 00:17:51.750
<i>But, now…</i>

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:58.375
Whoa, he dodged it!

00:17:58.458 --> 00:17:59.666
He dodged it!

00:18:04.916 --> 00:18:07.208
I've never seen anyone
dodge Jin-seong's punch.

00:18:11.583 --> 00:18:14.250
Why you little…

00:18:24.416 --> 00:18:26.083
He's got nowhere
to go now.

00:18:34.291 --> 00:18:36.125
<i>Oh, no.</i>
<i>He's gonna hit me for sure.</i>

00:18:39.458 --> 00:18:42.291
What was that? He blocked the punch?

00:18:44.333 --> 00:18:45.958
How did he do that?

00:18:46.041 --> 00:18:48.083
<i>Just by looking at my punch?</i>

00:18:48.416 --> 00:18:53.583
<i>This guy, he's definitely not new to this.</i>
<i>He has actual experience.</i>

00:18:54.208 --> 00:18:57.250
<i>Oh, what do I do?</i>
<i>It's getting harder to dodge his punches.</i>

00:18:57.333 --> 00:18:58.916
<i>At this rate, I'm going to get hit.</i>

00:19:00.791 --> 00:19:02.291
Wow, that was so cool.

00:19:02.416 --> 00:19:04.375
-I can't believe it.
-Huh?

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.250
<i>How did he do that?</i>

00:19:09.083 --> 00:19:12.125
<i>Anyway, I bet</i>
<i>that pig's parents are pigs just like him.</i>

00:19:17.166 --> 00:19:21.208
<i>See that? Always go</i>
<i>for the gut when you strike first!</i>

00:19:21.291 --> 00:19:22.500
<i>That will knock them right out.</i>

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:26.916
<i>This is nothing for a pro like me.</i>

00:19:38.333 --> 00:19:39.375
Gosh.

00:19:43.583 --> 00:19:45.708
He knocked
him out with a single punch.

00:19:45.791 --> 00:19:47.625
Hey,
Lee Jin-seong's down.

00:19:51.916 --> 00:19:53.458
Wow, that was awesome.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.333
Whoa, what was that?

00:19:57.833 --> 00:19:59.916
<i>Ugh,</i>
<i>this is so embarrassing.</i>

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:02.166
<i>Mi-jin saw the whole thing. </i>

00:20:05.958 --> 00:20:08.458
<i>Did I hit him that hard?</i>

00:20:10.541 --> 00:20:11.833
VOCAL DANCE CLASS

00:20:12.166 --> 00:20:13.416
<i>Lee Jin-seong did?</i>

00:20:15.916 --> 00:20:18.375
Yeah, he got knocked out
with a single punch.

00:20:18.666 --> 00:20:20.125
Everyone knows about it.

00:20:21.291 --> 00:20:23.791
So what? Is he better looking than me?

00:20:24.375 --> 00:20:25.583
Transfer student?

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:29.125
ARCHITECTURE CLASS

00:20:29.458 --> 00:20:30.666
<i>Park Hyeong-seok?</i>

00:20:35.041 --> 00:20:38.083
Is he good looking and popular?

00:20:40.791 --> 00:20:43.958
Then let's break him.

00:20:48.041 --> 00:20:52.000
Park Hyeong-seok,
Fashion Design. Surprising!

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.291
He got Basco the "Burn Knuckle"
to make a move.

00:20:56.083 --> 00:20:59.208
It's too bad.
Even though he just got here,

00:20:59.583 --> 00:21:04.875
his time has just run out.
